{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16097","headline":"寄汴州令狐相公 · 王建","name":"寄汴州令狐相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三军江口拥双旌，虎帐长开自教兵。\n机鏁恶徒狂寇尽，恩驱老将壮心生。\n水门向晚茶商闹，桥市通宵酒客行。\n秋日梁王池阁好，新歌散入管弦声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}